meta {
  name: Events - List
  type: http
  seq: 183
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of an events space>/events?scope=upcoming&limit=10&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The events of an events space (#1513). scope: upcoming (default, the events that end now or later, the drafts first, then the next start first) or past (the newest start first); another value is refused (400). A draft is listed only for its host, the owner and the admins. Lists carry no description. Ability events:read.
  Public: in a public space this request works without a session and without a token (never a draft, never the meeting address or the place; the host as name, username and avatar). Every other space answers 401 without an account.
}
